{"content_hash": "2de7ee1d1b930b3e", "version_id": 981, "article_id": 99, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "12.5 million US gamers plan to skip work for GTA 6", "title_zh": "1250万美国玩家打算为《GTA6》请假", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/027/486.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1717501216174-9dc275fe680d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8bWFnfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3OTE3ODd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Doriana Popa on Unsplash", "author": "Doriana Popa", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@ibreathart?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-table-topped-with-a-cake-and-flowers-XtPq1tkY7sA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(82, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(120, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "7ee29fdf7be5"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-16", "word_count": 95, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "Many people in the US want to play GTA 6 on its first day. Some will take time off work or school.", "lead_zh": "美国很多人想在《GTA6》发售第一天就玩上。有些人会为此请假，不去上班或上学。", "preview": "A new study says about 12.5 million US gamers have a plan. They will take a day off on November 19. That is the first day of GTA 6.", "preview_zh": "一项新调查称，约1250万美国玩家已有计划。他们会在11月19日请假一天。那天是《GTA6》发售的第一天。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 965, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 29.75, "size_bytes": 179424, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 30.4, "size_bytes": 183312, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 33.575, "size_bytes": 202464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 29.05, "size_bytes": 175248, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 30.5, "size_bytes": 183888, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/981.json", "paragraphs": ["A new study says about 12.5 million US gamers have a plan. They will take a day off on November 19. That is the first day of GTA 6.", "The study comes from PC Mag and YouGov. They asked 2,024 adults in the US. Eight percent of the gamers said they will take paid leave or change their day.", "Young people want to play most. Thirteen percent of them will change their plans. But 68 percent said they will not play on the first day.", "Some gamers will buy a new console for the game."], "paragraphs_zh": ["一项新调查称，约1250万美国玩家已有计划。他们会在11月19日请假一天。那天是《GTA6》发售的第一天。", "这项调查来自PC Mag和YouGov。他们询问了2024名美国成年人。8%的玩家说他们会请带薪假，或者调整当天的安排。", "年轻人最想玩。其中13%的人会改变自己的计划。但68%的人说，他们不会在第一天就玩。", "一些玩家会为这款游戏买新主机。另一些人会在晚上或周末玩。还有少数人会请两天假。"], "body": "A new study says about 12.5 million US gamers have a plan. They will take a day off on November 19. That is the first day of GTA 6.\n\nThe study comes from PC Mag and YouGov. They asked 2,024 adults in the US. Eight percent of the gamers said they will take paid leave or change their day.\n\nYoung people want to play most. Thirteen percent of them will change their plans. But 68 percent said they will not play on the first day.\n\nSome gamers will buy a new console for the game.", "body_zh": "一项新调查称，约1250万美国玩家已有计划。他们会在11月19日请假一天。那天是《GTA6》发售的第一天。\n\n这项调查来自PC Mag和YouGov。他们询问了2024名美国成年人。8%的玩家说他们会请带薪假，或者调整当天的安排。\n\n年轻人最想玩。其中13%的人会改变自己的计划。但68%的人说，他们不会在第一天就玩。\n\n一些玩家会为这款游戏买新主机。另一些人会在晚上或周末玩。还有少数人会请两天假。", "text": "A new study says about 12.5 million US gamers have a plan. They will take a day off on November 19. That is the first day of GTA 6. The study comes from PC Mag and YouGov. They asked 2,024 adults in the US. Eight percent of the gamers said they will take paid leave or change their day. Young people want to play most. Thirteen percent of them will change their plans. But 68 percent said they will not play on the first day. Some gamers will buy a new console for the game.", "vocab": [{"word": "gamer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "玩家", "note": "指玩游戏的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "take a day off", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "请假一天", "note": "常用说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "paid leave", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "带薪假", "note": "工作用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "study", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查；研究", "note": "这里指调查", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adult", "pos": "noun", "zh": "成年人", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "percent", "pos": "noun", "zh": "百分比；百分之……", "note": "8 percent 就是 8%", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "console", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏主机", "note": "如 PlayStation", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "weekend", "pos": "noun", "zh": "周末", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-16T01:16:24.797609", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "A", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "